---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  description="Media Tools collects no data. This website is static and hosted on GitHub Pages."
  title="Privacy — Media Tools"
>
  <article class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Local by design.</h1>
    <p>
      This website collects no data. It has no accounts, no analytics, no
      advertising trackers and no remote fonts or embedded third-party media.
    </p>
    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      The only thing the site remembers is the platform you pick in the
      installation guide. It is saved as <code>media-tools-platform</code> in
      your browser’s local storage, never leaves your browser, and can be
      removed through your browser’s site-data controls. Copy buttons only write
      the displayed command to your clipboard; they never read it.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and links</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, so GitHub may process connection data
      such as your IP address under its own{" "}
      <a
        href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        privacy statement
      </a>
      . Links to GitHub, Jellyfin, Python or FFmpeg providers lead to those
      services and their policies. They open in a new tab and do not send a
      referrer.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
